Hi everybody,

a first release candidate for tpm2-totp 0.2.0 has been tagged:

https://github.com/tpm2-software/tpm2-totp/releases/tag/v0.2.0_rc0

Most notably this release includes integration into initramfs images
generated by mkinitcpio, dracut and initramfs-tools to display the TOTP
during boot.

Any testing and feedback is highly appreciated.

Best regards,
Jonas


